      "claims": [
        {
          "text": "The templates gain these leading markers: granite and reka use <|endoftext|>; llama and mistral use <s>; llama3 uses <|begin_of_text|>; deepseek uses <｜begin▁of▁sentence｜>. Gemma retains its existing <bos>, while chatml and qwen3 gain no BOS text.",
