        {
          "text": "main substitutes the problem into the selected template, encodes it once, and passes the resulting input_ids to each sample Job. Special-token encoding stays enabled. Tokenizer.encode routes this through encode_special, whose underlying tokenizer call disables automatic special-token addition; the wrapper independently prepends bos_token_id only when add_bos is true and that ID exists.",
