        },
        {
          "text": "This removes the extra wrapper-inserted BOS from Gemma and avoids imposing one on ChatML/Qwen3. For the six newly prefixed templates, preservation of the old token sequence depends on the literal marker encoding to the same configured BOS ID; source inspection alone cannot establish that equivalence.",
