          "evidence": ["call_b269d990842b4a8483ffdd1ce9a36bef", "call_166e39fadc4d4369ae705a6843959404"]
        },
        {
          "text": "A standard-library check extracted the parent templates and modeled the patch: all problem-placeholder counts were preserved, and only explicit raw retained automatic BOS. The no-option path remained distinct from raw.",
